{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Dan shall judge his people.</b> He will avenge the vengeance of his people from the Philistines, as in ״כִּי יָדִין ה׳ עַמּוֹ״ (Deuteronomy 32)." "<b>As one of the tribes of Israel.</b> All Israel will be as one with him, and he will judge them all — and this was prophesied concerning Samson. And there is further to interpret <b>as one of the tribes of Israel</b>: like the most distinguished of the tribes — that is David, who came from Judah."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:10.725240032Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}